---
import MarketingLayout from '../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro'
import Header from '../react/components/Header.jsx'
import Footer from '../react/components/Footer.jsx'
---
<MarketingLayout title="Bi-Dash workspace" description="Bi-Dash: a self-hosted business intelligence workspace with flexible AI.">
<Header /><main class="container" style="padding-top:120px;padding-bottom:80px;min-height:65vh"><h1>Bi-Dash workspace</h1><h2>From a question to a dashboard</h2><p>Create queries, tables, bar and line charts, pies and counters from a prompt. Review the unpublished draft before publishing.</p><h2>Your data and AI configuration</h2><p>Connect your data sources and choose Ollama, OpenAI, Anthropic or an OpenAI-compatible provider. Save shared business context once in Settings.</p><h2>Roles and query controls</h2><p>Admin, Editor and Reader permissions control access. Timeouts and concurrency controls protect execution. The query editor controls optional row limiting.</p></main><Footer />
</MarketingLayout>
